## Out of scope (MVP)
- National wall-to-wall daily processing.
- Public mobile app.
- Advanced hydrodynamic simulation platform.
- Enterprise IAM/multi-tenancy.
- High-cost streaming geospatial stack.
- Kubernetes adoption before proven scaling bottlenecks.

